---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Chester Beard — GaiaVerity" desc="Chester Beard is the founder and lead writer at GaiaVerity, covering lawn care, soil health, native plants, and sustainable gardening backed by horticultural research and real-world testing.">

  <section style="background:#f7f5f0; padding:72px 24px 96px;">
    <div style="max-width:680px; margin:0 auto;">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
        <div style="width:88px; height:88px; border-radius:999px; background:#eef4f0; border:1px solid #d8e5dc; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;">
          <span class="font-sans" style="font-size:28px; font-weight:700; color:#5c7962;">CB</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-sans" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c98633; margin-bottom:8px;">Founder &amp; Writer</p>
          <h1 class="font-sans" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px); font-weight:700; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#23312b;">Chester Beard</h1>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="font-serif" style="font-size:17px; line-height:1.85; color:#23312b;">

        <p>I started GaiaVerity because I kept running into the same problem: most gardening advice online is either too generic to be useful or too buried in jargon to act on. I wanted a place that tells you what actually works in a real backyard — with real soil, real shade, and a real budget.</p>

        <p>I've spent years working with plants, soil, and the conditions that make or break a garden: clay that turns to concrete in August, shade from neighbor's trees, drought that no amount of watering seems to fix, and budgets that don't stretch to professional landscaping. That experience — the failures as much as the successes — shapes everything published here.</p>

        <p>Every guide on GaiaVerity starts with research from university extension services, the USDA, peer-reviewed horticulture, and mycology sources. When I make a claim, I try to back it with evidence. When something is opinion or personal experience, I say so. I'm honest about what I don't know, and I update articles when new information changes the picture.</p>

      </div>

      <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; margin-top:28px;">
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/chester-beard/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-sans"
          style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:12px 24px; border:1px solid #c98633; border-radius:999px; color:#c98633; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.85 3.36-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.45v6.29zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45z"/></svg>
          LinkedIn
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.pinterest.com/GaiaVerityGardens/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-sans"
          style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:12px 24px; border:1px solid #c98633; border-radius:999px; color:#c98633; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.08 3.16 9.42 7.63 11.17-.11-.95-.2-2.4.04-3.44.22-.93 1.4-5.96 1.4-5.96s-.36-.72-.36-1.78c0-1.67.97-2.91 2.17-2.91 1.02 0 1.52.77 1.52 1.69 0 1.03-.66 2.57-1 3.99-.28 1.2.6 2.18 1.79 2.18 2.15 0 3.8-2.27 3.8-5.54 0-2.9-2.08-4.93-5.06-4.93-3.45 0-5.47 2.58-5.47 5.25 0 1.04.4 2.15.9 2.76.1.12.11.22.08.34-.09.37-.29 1.2-.33 1.37-.05.22-.17.26-.4.16-1.5-.7-2.44-2.89-2.44-4.65 0-3.79 2.75-7.27 7.94-7.27 4.17 0 7.41 2.97 7.41 6.94 0 4.14-2.61 7.47-6.23 7.47-1.22 0-2.36-.63-2.75-1.38l-.75 2.85c-.27 1.04-1 2.35-1.49 3.15C9.9 23.57 10.93 24 12 24c6.63 0 12-5.37 12-12S18.63 0 12 0z"/></svg>
          Pinterest
        </a>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:36px;">
        <p class="font-sans" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c98633; margin-bottom:14px;">What I Cover</p>
        <div class="font-serif" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.75; color:#23312b;">
          <p><strong>Lawn care and mushrooms</strong> — Identification, safety, organic management, and the soil biology behind why things grow (or don't). This is the most-requested topic on the site, and the one where bad advice is most dangerous.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;"><strong>Soil health</strong> — Clay amendments, composting, no-dig methods, and the science of soil structure. I compare real costs and real timelines, not marketing claims.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;"><strong>Native and sustainable gardening</strong> — Pollinator gardens, drought-tolerant ground covers, lawn alternatives, and climate-resilient design for backyards that work with their environment.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;"><strong>Small-space and practical design</strong> — Vertical gardens, container growing, edible landscaping, and layouts for yards that don't have unlimited room or budget.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:36px;">
        <p class="font-sans" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c98633; margin-bottom:14px;">My Approach</p>
        <div class="font-serif" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.75; color:#23312b;">
          <p>GaiaVerity sells no products and has no affiliate relationships with soil amendment companies, seed suppliers, or tool brands. That independence means I can say plainly what works and what doesn't — including when the cheapest or free option is the best one.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;">My goal is simple: help you grow a yard that works <em>with</em> your land instead of against it — less water, fewer chemicals, and more life in the soil.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:40px; padding-top:28px; border-top:1px solid #d8e5dc;">
        <a href="/blog/" class="font-sans" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:#3B6D11; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">
          Read the latest guides
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
